%I A399362 #15 Sep 04 2026 00:52:56
%S A399362 0,0,1,2,7,26,140,815,5484,38563
%N A399362 The number of 3-connected cubic planar graphs on 2n-4 vertices that can be strongly embedded on the torus.
%C A399362 By a theorem of Weiß and Niemeyer, such an embedding exists if and only if the dual graph of the given graph contains specific subgraphs. The numbers were computed using GAP.
%H A399362 Meike Weiß, <a href="https://github.com/gap-packages/SimplicialSurfaces">GAP Code</a>.
%H A399362 Meike Weiß and Alice C. Niemeyer, <a href="https://dmtcs.episciences.org/19018">Strong Embeddings of 3-Connected Cubic Planar Graphs on Surfaces of non-negative Euler Characteristic</a>, Discrete Mathematics & Theoretical Computer Science, 2026.
%Y A399362 Cf. A399361 (on the projective plane), A399363 (on the Klein bottle).
%K A399362 nonn,more,new
%O A399362 4,4
%A A399362 _Meike Weiß_, Aug 27 2026
